ipt validator\n- T25: Implement NOOP fallback validator\n\nPhase 6: REST API\n- T26: Implement FastAPI app + middleware (auth, rate limit)\n- T27: Implement POST /documents endpoint\n- T28: Implement GET /documents/{id} endpoint\n- T29: Implement GET /documents endpoint (list with pagination)\n- T30: Implement GET /documents/{id}/image endpoint\n- T31: Implement GET /health endpoint\n\nPhase 7: Async Processing\n- T32: Implement PostgreSQL SKIP LOCKED job queue\n- T33: Implement OCR worker (consumes queue, runs pipeline)\n- T34: Implement worker main loop\n\nPhase 8: Storage Lifecycle\n- T35: Implement storage usage checker\n- T36: Implement retention policy engine\n- T37: Implement lifecycle scheduler (APScheduler)\n\nPhase 9: API Key Management\n- T38: Implement API key hashing & verification\n- T39: Implement admin CLI for key management\n\nPhase 10: BDD Tests\n- T40: Write ingestion feature + steps\n- T41: Write status retrieval feature + steps\n- T42: Write list feature + steps\n- T43: Write OCR feature + steps\n- T44: Write validation AR feature + steps\n- T45: Write pluggable validation feature + steps\n- T46: Write rate limit feature + steps\n- T47: Write auth feature + steps\n- T48: Write storage lifecycle feature + steps\n\nPhase 11: Unit Tests (TDD per component)\n- T49-T60: Unit tests for domain models, services, adapters\n\nPhase 12: Validation & Docs\n- T61: Final lint + typecheck + test run\n- T62: Write README + API docs verification\n\n### 6. pyproject.toml Scaffold\n\n```toml\n[build-system]\nrequires = [\"hatchling\"]\nbuild-backend = \"hatchling.build\"\n\n[project]\nname = \"doc-processing-service\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.12\"\ndependencies = [\n    \"fastapi>=0.115\",\n    \"uvicorn[standard]>=0.30\",\n    \"sqlalchemy[asyncio]>=2.0\",\n    \"asyncpg>=0.29\",\n    \"alembic>=1.13\",\n    \"pydantic>=2.0\",\n    \"pydantic-settings>=2.0\",\n    \"minio>=7.2\",\n    \"paddleocr>=2.8\",\n    \"easyocr>=1.7\",\n    \"Pillow>=